# Adaptive layout

This scenario verifies that the picker redraws when the terminal width changes.
At narrow widths the session list and preview are stacked vertically; once the
terminal is wide enough they switch to a side-by-side layout.

Attach a live `alpha` session to a repository with a described commit, giving
the preview recognizable content as the picker is resized.

    :b jj (available)
    :cp tests/fixtures/jjconfig.toml .jjconfig.toml (copied)
    :t rename-session -t 0 runner (success)
    :$ smth --no-base --create-repo --create alpha (exit: 0)

```stdout
alpha
```

    :$ -q jj describe -R alpha -m "alpha commit" (exit: 0)
    :t new-session -d -s ui "smth -r alpha" (success)
    :t resize-window -t ui:0 -x 120 -y 10 (success)
    :p ui:0.0
    :settle -d 2s (settled)

This snapshot shows the narrow stacked layout, including the horizontal
footer above the horizontal separator between the session list and preview.

    :k alpha
    :snap "/\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2} \d{2}:\d{2}:\d{1,2}/t" "/(?:@|○|◆)\s+([a-z]{8})/w" "/\b([0-9a-f]{8})\b/h"

```terminal
session: alpha
  1/3 | [C-r] repo: none
▌■ alpha                                    ~/alpha                                                                    ┃
 [C-x] close, [C-f] flag
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
@  wwwwwwww (no email set) ttttttttttttttttttt hhhhhhhh
│  (empty) alpha commit
◆  wwwwwwww root() hhhhhhhh


```

After widening the terminal, the picker should redraw with the session list and
preview side by side. The footer stays beneath the session list, while the
preview uses the full terminal height.

    :t resize-window -t ui:0 -x 180 -y 10 (success)
    :snap "/\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2} \d{2}:\d{2}:\d{1,2}/t" "/(?:@|○|◆)\s+([a-z]{8})/w" "/\b([0-9a-f]{8})\b/h"

```terminal
session: alpha                                                                                             ┃@  wwwwwwww (no email set) ttttttttttttttttttt hhhhhhhh
  1/3 | [C-r] repo: none                                                                                   ┃│  (empty) alpha commit
▌■ alpha                                    ~/alpha                                                        ┃◆  wwwwwwww root() hhhhhhhh
                                                                                                           ┃
                                                                                                           ┃
                                                                                                           ┃
                                                                                                           ┃
                                                                                                           ┃
                                                                                                           ┃
 [C-x] close, [C-f] flag                                                                                   ┃
```

The same arrangement should hold when the preview reaches its maximum width.

    :t resize-window -t ui:0 -x 260 -y 10 (success)
    :snap "/\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2} \d{2}:\d{2}:\d{1,2}/t" "/(?:@|○|◆)\s+([a-z]{8})/w" "/\b([0-9a-f]{8})\b/h"

```terminal
session: alpha                                                                                                                                                 ┃@  wwwwwwww (no email set) ttttttttttttttttttt hhhhhhhh
  1/3 | [C-r] repo: none                                                                                                                                       ┃│  (empty) alpha commit
▌■ alpha                                    ~/alpha                                                                                                            ┃◆  wwwwwwww root() hhhhhhhh
                                                                                                                                                               ┃
                                                                                                                                                               ┃
                                                                                                                                                               ┃
                                                                                                                                                               ┃
                                                                                                                                                               ┃
                                                                                                                                                               ┃
 [C-x] close, [C-f] flag                                                                                                                                       ┃
```

Hiding the preview leaves the footer aligned with the session list, excluding
its scrollbar column.

    :k C-p
    :snap

```terminal
